  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">안녕하세요! 처음 글을 올려봅니다.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">중학교 1학년 생물다양성 단원에서 생물 다양성의 중요성을 게임활동을 통해 몸과 마음으로&nbsp;인식하는 수업방법 입니다.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">학생들과 진행하면서 4번 정도 패치를 했는데 아직 부족한 점이 있습니다.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">좋은 아이디어나 개선점 있으시면 가감없이 부탁드립니다!</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">감사합니다^^</p><p><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D681%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20181014190329&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile264.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9999053F5BC313C820EB60')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_pdf_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 중학교1학년 생존게임.pdf</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
